","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":8,"created_at":"2026-06-11T12:57:35Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T15:25:20Z","closed_at":"2026-06-18T15:25:20Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.7.rc1 \n- Not reproducible in: 4.6.3\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 - Godot Engine v4.7.rc1 - (Vulkan Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3090\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf you instantiate a scene that has a CollisionShape2D/3D child node, make it editable, and then add a new Shaoe2D/3D, you won't be able to modify the shape right away unless you do one of the following:\n\n- Save the scene, click away and then click on the CollisionShape\n- Save then scene, switch to another tab, and then switch back\n- Reload the scene\n- Reload the project\n\nAs the image below shows after adding the shape you won't get the orange modification circle untill you do one of the above:\n\n<img width=\"2059\" height=\"1168\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f472084f-3c66-410e-bcbf-b0f26a9dbc31\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create an new Aead2D (or any other node)\n- Add a CollisionShape2D child node and save the scene\n- Create a new Node2D scene\n- Instantiate the scene created in the second step as a child node and make it editable\n- Add a new Shape2D to the CollisionShape2D and try to modify it (you won't be able to)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[collision_shape_bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28838834/collision_shape_bug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120192/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120192/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}